        "Eli Yablonovitch",
        "John D. Joannopoulos",
        "Sajeev John"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Photonic band gaps supplied a powerful physical means to control light propagation and spontaneous emission using structured dielectrics.",
        "attribution": "John and Yablonovitch established key concepts, while Joannopoulos made central theoretical and design contributions.",
        "maturity": "The ideas have generated a mature field and many experimentally successful photonic-crystal devices.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The relative weight of conceptual prediction, fabrication, and later device advances requires careful attribution."
        ]
      }
    },
